The new updates as follow: (04/10 3:00 pm)
Optimization:

1. Adjusted the probability of recruiting fortress generals. 
For generals with Affinity ≤ 25, the probability has been adjusted from 15% to 50%; 
for generals with Affinity = 50, the probability has been adjusted from 10% to 30%; 
for generals with Affinity ≥ 50, the probability has been adjusted from 8% to 15%.

Bug fixes:

1. Fixed the issue of incorrect background color for the Hana card;
2. Fixed the crash issue caused by Horse race types.

