notes.content:
The new updates as follow: (9/20 3:00 pm)
1.Add-on contents:
1.) Add the feature of saving custom difficulty 
(1)Automatically save while load scenario;
(2)The new difficulty save will cover the last one;
(3)Default difficulty (Simple, Normal, Hard, and etc) will not be saved;

2.Contents fixing:
1.) Fixed the bug about Spy and Search 100% coverage rate after finishing Tutorial;
2.) Fixed the crash that uses the horse in Stable to join in Horse Race;
3.) Fixed the crash that crossbred and press OK in Vietnamese version on Steam.
4.) Fixed the error about BGM broadcasting at Horse Race ending.

The new updates as follow: (8/30 3:00 pm)
1.New content: Horse Race
1). Competition system:
From the scenario start, the game will be hold by Han Emperor each two years;
Total 10 participators, 5 for each single round, the top 2 to final game;
2.) Rewards:
Top 1: random 1 exclusive set( whole 8 sets); 
Second: scroll

3.Adjustment:
1.) [Seer]
Only remain one set(Yicheng-Guo Jia’s), original other sets will be transferred to the rewards of Bandit and Alien;
2.) [Waiter]
Wager: decreased to 1,0000; Rewards: 2,0000 coins and materials for winner; nothing for loser;

4.Contents fixing:
1.Fixed the configuration about Liu Rui and Sun Ba birth time in 215 scenario;
2.Fixed the display error in Task Report about Personage arriving;
3.Fixed the relationship of Hu Zong and Hu Chong, Wang Yuanji and Wang Su;
4.Fixed the issue about several officers’ Bios.
新;

The new updates as follow: (7/7 2:00 pm)
[DLC- Hana Card]
1.Seer arriving:(Difficulty unchanged)
1.) Added random round(s) through flop point. And the winner would declare in (1-12) rounds; 
2.) Adjusted HP of both sides from 99 to 60;
3.) Rewards adjustment
(1). Total win: Opposite HP reaches to 0 in round(Exclusive set will be definitely obtained, and no repetition) 
(2). Win: Our HP> opposite HP after the round(Probability of obtaining exclusive set will be higher with lower opposite HP, reward including: sets and pages)
(3). Gain Bullion when lose;
(4). Added exclusive sets of Speedy March and Solo Hero;
(5). Canceled Bullion reward when win;
(6). Finishing all four exclusive sets collection, there is only Pages available to obtain.

2.Wagering(Easy difficulty)
Added event ‘Wagering’ in Tavern where player can play card with Waiter(Click ‘Hana Card, and cost 5,000 coins to start)
Rewards:
(1). Total win: Opposite HP reaches to 0 in round(Obtain 10,000 coins, Books or its materials)
(2). Win: Our HP> opposite HP after the round(Obtain 10,000 coins)
(3). Lose: No any rewards

3.Optimization:
1.) Increased the speed of Deal;
2.) Optimized UI of settlement(Unintended touch will not appear at all);

4.Main story optimization: 
1.) Rearranged officer-Chen Ji from Yuan Shu’s force to free officer in 190 and 195 scenarios;
2.) Fixed the issue of display on Auto Battle.

This new updates as follow: (6/22 2:00 pm)
1.New contents:
1.) The brand-new DLC, Generals Cards Play, will be claimed for free in the latest version release.
2.) The Hana deck is divided into 12 forces with 4 Generals per force, which sums up to 48 cards;
3.) There are several fixed combinations, which different combination activated will get the corresponding score;
4.) Victory will gain within the combination(s) achieved; or choose “Continue” to activate more combinations;
5.) Draw will be triggered while both sides run out of cards, and no any combination activated;
6.) The initial HP with each side is 99, which one of the sides will lose the game while HP is empty;

2.Trigger conditions of Hana Card
1.) [Debate] Player is able to choose playing Leaf Card or Hana Card in settings, ;
2.) [Tavern] Start the game when Seer is coming to the capital;

3.The Rewards
1.) Only can be obtained through playing with Seer in Tavern; 
2.) Random items (total 17 items, including the new added exclusive suits of Beauty·Diao Chan, and Langzhong·Zhang Fei);
3.) Rewards only can be got when finish the whole game(one win, one lose); Random items for win, Bullion for lose;
4.) There is no any rewards for the Round over or leave halfway.
3.) Fixed the bug that officer under AI’s control will automatically release skills and use ladders at the same time.

This new updates as follow: (5/25 3:00 pm)
1.Optimization:
1.) Added new exclusive suits for Zhuge Liang and Zhou Yu as the rewards of Bandit;
2.) Increased the probability of the officers in Bandit becoming player’s subordinates ;

2.Bug fixing:
1.) Fixed the error of Archery using Volley;
2.) Fixed the display error in battle report about the wounded vice officer after using Shoot Never Miss;
3.) Fixed the bug that officer under AI’s control will automatically release skills and use ladders at the same time.

This new updates as follow: (3/25 3:00 pm.)
1.Optimization 
1.) Canceled in-game decoration about Chinese New Year;
2.) Optimized auto formation that the officer in task would not be chosen automatically, but could be by manually

2.Bug fixing
1.) Fixed the problem that the in-game Cheating is not closed when player has closed the function in Settings;
2.) Fixed the crash problem about Black Tortoise releasing skill;
3.) Fixed the error that the target cannot be selected due to check ‘Troops’;
4.) Fixed the bug of free officers.

This new updates as follow: (2/18 3:00 pm.)
1.New contents:
1.) The entrance of ‘Anecdotes’ will be closed;
2.) Custom officer: added 6 avatars from ‘Anecdotes’ that can be used when create officer;

2. Bug fixing:
1.）Fixed the crash of ‘Stable’ in Vietnamese version.

The Last  Warlord Version Patch No. 139 Update Notice （V1.0.0.323）
1.New contents:
1)Custom officer, avatar and treasures all are gathered into ‘Create’;

2.Adds the function of ‘custom treasures’, which can support to distribute the created treasures to corresponding force as player’s willing.
1)The treasures can be able to edit properties and custom icon, level, type, price, and description etc.;
2)Player is capable of treasures distribution when start a new scenario;
3)The in-game function, Cheating, is supported to rearrange the properties of custom treasure.

3.The upper limit value of legendary weapon properties are advanced.

New content added:
1. Added the voice effects of entering scenes and rain;

Fixed Bugs:
1. Fixed the error of the place names on Field;
2. Fixed the error of effective attack range of the fire traps;
3. Fixed the error of the number of special troops deployed.

Update Content: (November 26, 17: 00)
New and optimized content: 
1. Optimized the speed of CPU technology research and development. CPU does research once a month under the difficulty of 250 or higher.  
Fixed Bugs: 
1. Fixed the bug that cavalry was able to attack troops in the city after using "Instigate Rebellion";  
2.Fixed a bug in creating new officers;  
3.Fixed the bug that the CPU cavalry would die directly after being attacked if dismounting and using "Impenetrable Defense". 
4.Fixed the time error of Sun Yi's official career;  
5.Fixed the bug that caused abnormal troop strength when cavalry dismounted and used recovery stunts;  
6.Fixed the bug that infantry and archer could not release "Flooded Seven Armies" under heavy rain;  
7.Fixed the bug that the details of other technologies could not be viewed when researching technology;  
8.Fixed the bug that the loyalty would decrease after the auto appointment titles is not confirmed or closed.

Update Content: (October 31, 14: 00)
New and optimized content: 
1.Added a reminder that proclaiming the emperor may cause bad reputation; 
2.Added the function of changing the age of new officers with one key; 
3.Optimized Report. There's a record of when a CPU force perishes. 
4.Optimized officers' move. When a CPU force tries to move officers, the first successor won't be removed from the capital. If the first successor is out of the capital, he or she will be transferred back to the capital whenever possible. 
Fixed Bugs: 
1. Fixed the problem of One Worth Ten, which do not cause damage to the gates and equipment; 
2. Fixed the display problem of Resplendent Thorned Mace; 
3. Fixed some interface text errors;
4.Fixed the problem that the game crashed once using skills in manual battle of English version;

Update Content: (October 17, 16: 00)
New and optimized content: 
1.Optimized Template function in Deploy. Changed the number of storage to 10 and added a reminder for each Template saved; 
2.Optimized the special skill Kick Ass. Disorder lasts for 1 round. 
3.Optimized the speed of CPU technology research and development in difficult mode. 
4.Optimized the notice for new players. 
5.Added a location profile for the main city building, where you can freely adjust the location of buildings in main city; 
6. Added a switch (Settings-System) to turn on and off all animations in main city; 
Fixed Bugs: 
1. Fixed the bug that Cao Zhi could not write books after he left office. 
2.Fixed the relationship network Sun Ba ; 
3.Fixed a configuration bug that caused a flashback after the troops were eliminated after Shen Pei releases skills; 
4.Fixed the bug that the special skill Kick Ass would cause one's officers to be captured and surrendered; 
5.Fixed the mistake of Yang Zhi and Jia Wu's official year in the scenario of The Northern Expedition; 
6.Fixed the bug that the intimacy between Cao Ren and Cao Cao is 0.

Update Content: (18:00, September 24)
New and optimized content: 
1.Optimized a diplomatic function--Request for Troop: increased the number of troops sent by CPU;  
2.Optimized a diplomatic function--Technology Exchange: increased the frequency of Technology Exchange of CPU; 
3.Optimized a diplomatic function--Persuade: added the display of requirements; 
Fixed BUGs: 
1. Fixed the BUG that players can't gain Lv.10 magical weapon in the instance of Snow Mountain.
2.Fixed the BUG that the successor interface is not refreshed after abdicating;  
3.Fixed the BUG that player’s army will not attack AI when encountering ambush in grass;  
4.Fixed the BUG of Zhao Yun's relationship;  
5.Fixed the BUG of abnormal caravan data;  
6.Fixed the BUG that the treasure chest flashs back after the battle;  
7.Fixed the BUG that the special skill of Kick Ass can not be triggered in field battles; 
8.Fixed the BUG that the special skill of Reorganize Discipline; 
9.Fixed the BUG that the Copper Mine mission in Proposal could not be accessed;  
10.Fixed a crash issue caused by an error in the configuration table of Shen Pei.

Update Content: (11:00, September 19)
New and optimized content: 
1.Added a diplomatic function:Request for troops--you can ask the force of the same Union for troops to attack the enemy city;  
2.Added a diplomatic function:Technology Exchange--You can request technology from other forces, and use your own technology or resources for exchange;  
3.Remade the diplomatic function:Solicit Surrender--You can persuade the neighboring force of only one city to surrender (stringent requirements);  
4.Added a strategy function:Demolition--You can send an officer and 100 troops to invade and destroy the target city, reducing its government attributes;  
5.Added a strategy function:Bewitch--You can send an officer to an enemy city to lobby the prefect, to compel him to break away from the original force and become independent. 
6.Remade the strategy function:Alliance--You can also initiate the "anti-○○ alliance" like AI before. If succeed, you can unite multiple forces to siege one;  
7.Remade Forecast in the battlefield: You can specify weather changes, and it will take effect in the next round;  
8.Remade Disorder in the battlefield: It can be used against any enemy unit. If successful, the enemy unit will attack the nearest unit of its side;  
9.Added the second batch of officers special skills:A total of 38 special skills and 4 special skills of custom officers;  
10.Added ruler abdicating function. After abdicating, the new ruler succeeds to the throne according to the order of succession, and the abdicated ruler becomes a general officer of the force;  
11.Expanded the Proposal system: Added 6 material collection missions;  
12.Optimized the selection of officers: Added weapon type classification in the officer information and reward list;  
13.Optimized the game mechanism: The probability of disasters and officers' independence and rebellion will increase as the number of game rounds increases;  
14.Optimized the game mechanism: Adjusted the probability of officer's injury. The low probability is lower, and the high probability is higher;  
15.Optimized the game mechanism: The algorithm for children's attributes is adjusted;  
16.Added avatars: 6 in total. 
Fixed the BUGs: 
1.Fixed the issue of female avatars appearing in the male avatar number 1359 in Create Officer;  
2.Fixed the bug that players can reward the Birth Magic to female officers;  
3.Fixed Reward BUG that replacing items does not increase intimacy;  
4.Fixed the bug that one unit can attack others from a long distance after being stopped in the battlefield ;  
5.Fixed the mistakes of the biographies and force of some officers;

Update Content: (18:00, July 17)
1. Added Portuguese and Thai versions;
2. Added 3 new DLC (free to access);
3. Added six selected scenarios;
4. Only supports 64-bit ;
5. Optimized the battlefield
1) Removed the field's own alert range setting and retained only the setting of rescuing commander.
2) Optimized the way that the archery approaches after triggering the setting of rescuing commander  and they will no longer stick up directly to melee attacks.
3) Enhanced the combat AI with the addition of a full ambush patch, which will march to the nearest ambush point.
4) Strengthened the combat AI and added the setting that the troops will counterattack when ambushed. 
6. Optimized the problem that the OK button disappears when editing the officer's name or biography on some mobile phones.
7. Fixed some known BUGs and interface problems.

