Update Content: (April 3 17:00)
1. New Function: Legion
1) Entrance: Special-Legion
2) Each force can establish up to 6 legions, all the cities default as Legion 1;
3) The Legion System consists of three functions: New, Edit, and Policy;
4) New: By selecting the city, goverment location, governor and officials(non-essential) to establish a new Legion;
5) Edit: Edit the existing Legion(s). (the Legion 1 can not be edited), you can edit the Legion's cities, officials.Governor and goverment location are not editable;
6) Policy: Select an existing Legion and set Policy for it. The AI ​​will automatically manage cities according to the policy you arranged.
2. Optimized battlefield performance
1) Replaced all old army models with new ones;
2) Replaced all battlefield effects;
3. Optimized Officer Editor.New Custom Face function is available.
1) Now you can create custom face graphic through the tool and use it when creating a new officer;
4. Added some pop-up illustrations;
5. Added some new force color;
6. Optimized Han Emperor system and reduced the offering consumption;
7. Optimized item icon;
1) All items have been replaced with new icons;
8. Optimized the formula of Rebel, increased the weight of notoriety;
9. Optimized the rule of random loyalty reduce;
10. Optimized maternity and improved the birth chance of young and elder officer;
11. Fixed other known bugs and interface problems.

