notes.content:
The main contents of this update are as follows: (December 12, 09:15)
1. New Automatic Combat Function
1) A new formation system has been added. You need to set up the formation before the battle. Different formations have different effects;
2) A pre-war Spy Reconnaissance has been added, through which you can preview the formation of your enemy troops;
3) Automatic battle adopts the grid sand table now. The troops are represented with cards. The two sides rush to each other just like on a chessboard. The combat process cannot be manually interfered; 
2. New Editor Features
1) Remove the former scenario editor;
2) The function of self-edited officers is optimized; 
3) When you open a new game and select the scenario, you can create a new force and attach self-edited officers to it; 
3.  Now you can see the details of officers’ battle deeds, troops’ casualty statistics and city damage after a battle; 
4. Optimized computer AI: Adjusted the algorithm of computer Employ, Cajole and voluntary-surrender;
5. Optimized the "Contact Us" function. Now it is available in the main interface;
6. Optimized the Debate. Now there are tips in the card gameplay;
7. Optimized the Banquet. "Compatibility" and "Intimate" will influence the happening of random events;
8. Optimized the battlefield
1) Added icon prompts when the troops are in the state of “climbing the city” or “infeasible climbing the city”; when releasing the “Fire”, you can see its range;
2) When climbing the city wall, if the land grid where the climbing troop locates at that time is on fire, the climb action will be interrupted. If a land grid is on fire, no climb action can be done there. 
9. Optimized the small map: Click the icons next to the two above buttons “Visit” and “Event”, the areas where corresponding events happen will be displayed in highlighted state;
10. Optimized Diplomacy. Temporarily blocked the “Persuade” function;
11. Optimized Marriage. Now, when the female military commander remarries, she will no longer marry a close relative;
12. Optimized the function of Search. When the officer who is exploring outside is in the state of “dying”, he will automatically return to the capital; 
13. Optimized the setting of random decreased loyalty. Officers who are in relationship of Sworn Siblings, husband and wife, father and son, mother and child with the ruler will be excluded;
14. Fixed known bugs and some interface issues.

Update content: (30th Oct 14:40)
1.The first feature of Yuan Shu displays wrongly;
2.A wrong officer appears in the officer list;
3.When you employ an enemy, the success rate is not displayed correctly;
4.Crash at the end of a month in some cases;
5.When you remove a captive's equipment, his loyalty to his former ruler is reduced;
6.A 16-year-old officer who just entered the official becomes "dying" the next month;
7.The abnormal display of a city after it was upgraded into  "Huge" ;
8.Incorrect success rate of "Cajole".

Update content: (26th Oct 16:30)

1. Optimized siege battle AI
1) Adjusted the formation of troops on the defending city;
2) Fixed the bug: the defending city ignores the siege troops and attacks the flag;
2. Optimized the initial technology of the forces, and corrected the bug: the post-technology is available before its pre-technology is opened; 
3. Optimized the scenario configuration and fixed some officer’s configuration errors; 
4. Optimized forging
1) In the forging interface, the probabilities of each level of weapons are displayed;
2) Increased the forging probability of level 10 weapons; 
5. Optimized the Special Training in College
1) The number of special trainings can be accumulated and will not be cleared;
2) When a child become an official, he will no longer take over his father’s position—now he become an officer of the capital. 
3) Increased the Ex given to the trained child every round in College: he can get more Ex from the headmaster, the teachers and the city scale than before. 
6. Optimized city upgrade settings
1) All cities can upgrade to the scale “large”; 
2) Added icons of city scales in the “Upgrade” interface so that you can see what level your city can upgrade to; 
7. Optimized the default settings of the difficulty“Hell”; 
8. Fixed some other known bugs and interface problems;

Update content: (19th Oct 19:00)
1. Optimized city features:
1) Added an urban feature: forging materials production;
2) Once gained, city features will keep taking effect;
2. Fixed the following bug: if the player sent troops to block the road, when the condition(s) met, the computer will attack the troops; 
3. Increased the effect of soldiers’ tiredness. During siege wars, the morale of troop reduces every 30 days;
4. Optimized the time of Infamy gain when attacking allies. Click the “Confirm” button in the dialog box and the infamy will increase immediately. 
5. The rate of successful forging action is increased. 
6. Improved battlefield AI: enhanced primary protection for the chief. 
7. Fixed the bug that the computer dispatches troops without a deputy;
8. Fixed the bug of crash when using the skill “fire”;
9. Fixed the bug that using the function of "summoning NPCs" might cause the computer to attack the player.
10. Fixed the Bug that the Heavy Infantry is not automatically recruited in branch cities. 
11. Fixed some other known bugs and interface problems.

1. Fixed the crashed in the siege battlefields since last patch；
2. Fixed the deployed legion that is stuck in the big map view;
3. Enhanced the big map view; now you can click city model to open the menu;
4. Enhanced siege battlefield;
5. Improved Ai；
6. Fixed some Ui.
